  "content": "<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>本專案無限期暫停。未來更新狀況未知。</strong></span></h3><p>描述</p><p>一個簡單的資源包，可以讓 Goety 的使徒不那麼可怕。</p><p>與 Apollyon 相容。</p><p>模型有點粗糙且僵硬。我已經盡力了。</p><p>需要「Entity Model Features」模組</p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">使徒</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332976/description_ca9e1764-4a3c-4ab1-9d2c-8c58b6a6daa1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"652\"></p><p><span style=\"color:#169179\">屍靈</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332976/description_df8e6f44-f78b-475f-89b9-8ccc79cf3d8f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"844\" height=\"632\"></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">阿波利翁</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332976/description_7f97a01c-dd4b-48fc-9641-c8ec2015fd71.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"548\"></p><div>此資源包是為 Goety 模組製作的。\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n它修改了使徒模型，並與 Goety: Revelation 相容。</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>[動畫部分來源聲明]</div><div><br>本資源包的動畫部分基於 Emmie_4 的作品「Cute Mob Models Resource Pack」的修改。<br>原始專案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cute-mob-models-resource-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cute-mob-models-resource-pack</a><br>根據 GNU 通用公共許可證 v3 的條款重新發布。</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>\n<div>\n<div>部分動畫靈感來自 FreshLX 的 Fresh Animations。</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations</a></div>\n</div>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div>",
